  "description": "<h2 level=\"2\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-text-200 mt-1 -mb-0.5\">Brand Introduction:</h2>\r\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\">Decaf Before Death is a specialty coffee service dedicated to exceptional decaffeinated coffee. We challenge the \"Death Before Decaf\" stereotype by sourcing, curating, and roasting the world's most innovative and flavorful decaf coffees. Featured in specialty coffee circles and endorsed by industry experts like Lance Hedrick as \"the coolest new subscription on the block,\" we're revolutionizing how people experience decaf.</p>\r\n<h2 level=\"2\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-text-200 mt-1 -mb-0.5\">Product Description:</h2>\r\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\">We offer several product categories that affiliates can promote:</p>\r\n<ul depth=\"0\" class=\"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7\">\r\n<li index=\"0\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Quarterly Discovery Box</strong>: Four curated specialty decafs (60g each) from international and UK roasters</li>\r\n<li index=\"1\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Premium Monthly Subscription</strong>: Full-sized bags of rare, experimental, and award-winning decafs</li>\r\n<li index=\"2\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Limited Edition Drops</strong>: Exclusive releases of exceptional coffees, often UK-first offerings</li>\r\n<li index=\"3\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>House-Roasted Coffees</strong>: Small-batch decafs roasted in-house, from experimental to daily-drivers</li>\r\n<li index=\"4\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Specialty Coffee Filters</strong>: Premium filters specifically chosen for optimal decaf brewing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 level=\"2\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-text-200 mt-1 -mb-0.5\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</h2>\r\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\">Decaf Before Death stands out by:</p>\r\n<ul depth=\"0\" class=\"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7\">\r\n<li index=\"0\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Focusing exclusively on premium specialty decaf coffee (not an afterthought)</li>\r\n<li index=\"1\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Sourcing from award-winning producers and innovative roasters</li>\r\n<li index=\"2\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Offering UK-exclusive coffees not available elsewhere</li>\r\n<li index=\"3\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Providing educational content about experimental processing methods</li>\r\n<li index=\"4\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Emphasizing lighter roasts and experimental profiles rarely found in decaf</li>\r\n<li index=\"5\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Building a community that celebrates quality regardless of caffeine content</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 level=\"2\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-text-200 mt-1 -mb-0.5\">Payment Terms:</h2>\r\n<ul depth=\"0\" class=\"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7\">\r\n<li index=\"0\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">5% commission on all sales made through your unique affiliate link</li>\r\n<li index=\"2\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">30-day cookie window for tracking referrals</li>\r\n<li index=\"4\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Payment via PayPal or store credit</li>\r\n<li index=\"5\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Commission on the product value (excluding shipping costs)</li>\r\n<li index=\"6\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Easy tracking&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 level=\"2\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-text-200 mt-1 -mb-0.5\">Other Information:</h2>\r\n<ul depth=\"0\" class=\"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7\">\r\n<li index=\"1\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Exclusive affiliate discount codes available for higher-performing partners</li>\r\n<li index=\"2\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Regular product updates to keep you informed about new releases</li>\r\n<li index=\"4\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Transparency about stock levels to avoid promoting sold-out items</li>\r\n<li index=\"5\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">UK-based company with shipping to UK, select EU countries, and now the US</li>\r\n<li index=\"6\" class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Ideal affiliate partners include coffee bloggers, health/wellness content creators, sleep specialists, and specialty food reviewers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\">Join us in changing perceptions about decaf coffee and earn commission while introducing your audience to truly exceptional coffee experiences!</p>",
